WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:01.500
Kill!

00:25.400 --> 00:31.000
What a tragedy: the Prince of Jin was defeated and ordered to commit suicide, and the Chen clan's eldest daughter leaped from the pavilion to follow him in death.

00:31.000 --> 00:37.000
Such boundless devotion—even having lost the empire, their fate pierces the deepest corners of the heart.

00:37.000 --> 00:44.000
As the old adage goes: 'Priceless treasures are easily sought, but a faithful lover is rare beyond measure.' Alas, a doomed pair of lovers forever bound in tragedy.
